    "title": "Sabrina Carpenter's Only 2026 Tour Stop is Coachella Weekend 2 - Coachella Today",
    "text": "Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›The glittering, high-fashion textures of Sabrina Carpenter's Coachella performance capture the pop star's magnetic stage presence.Coachella TodaySabrina Carpenter is coming off the high of headlining the opening night of Coachella 2026, but the 26-year-old pop star has not announced any other concerts or tour plans for this year. That means her only scheduled live performance in 2026 will be at Coachella's second weekend on April 17. Why it matters Carpenter has built a dedicated fanbase through viral hits like \"House Tour\" and her \"Short 'N' Sweet\" tour in 2025. With no other tour dates announced, Coachella Weekend 2 represents the only chance for many fans to see the rising star perform live in 2026. The details Tickets are still available for Coachella's second weekend, with weekend passes starting at $1,752. Single-day Friday passes to see Carpenter, along with other acts like Teddy Swims and KATSEYE, start at $1,923. Sabrina Carpenter headlined the opening night of Coachella 2026.Carpenter wrapped up her \"Short 'N' Sweet\" tour in November 2025.Carpenter is scheduled to perform at Coachella Weekend 2 on April 17, 2026 around 9 p.m. PST. What’s next USA TODAY Shopping will provide updates if Carpenter announces any additional tour dates or concerts in 2026. The takeaway With no other tour dates announced, Carpenter's Coachella Weekend 2 performance represents the only chance for many fans to see the rising pop star perform live in 2026.",
